---
// TEMPORARY font/icon check page (typical CN post + every CJK weight in use). Delete once real pages exist.
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import katex from 'katex';

const tex = (s: string) => katex.renderToString(s, { throwOnError: false });
---

<BaseLayout title="Font check · Gino's Blog">
	<div style="max-width:1024px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px;display:flex;gap:32px">
		<aside class="gb-sidebar">
			<div class="gb-brand">
				<a class="gb-site-title" href="/">Gino's Blog</a>
				<p class="gb-tagline">心之所向，身之所往。</p>
			</div>
			<nav class="gb-nav">
				<a class="gb-nav-item" aria-current="page"><Icon name="ri-article-line" />Articles</a>
				<a class="gb-nav-item"><Icon name="ri-user-3-line" />About Me</a>
				<a class="gb-nav-item"><Icon name="ri-folder-open-line" />Categories</a>
				<a class="gb-nav-item"><Icon name="ri-archive-line" />Archives</a>
			</nav>
		</aside>
		<main style="flex:1;min-width:0">
			<a class="gb-card" href="#">
				<div class="gb-card-meta">
					<time class="gb-date">2026-07-01 01:53:46</time>
					<span class="gb-catpath"># Computer Organization ▷ Cache</span>
				</div>
				<div class="gb-card-head"><h2 class="gb-card-title">01 Cache Fundamentals 快取基礎</h2></div>
				<p class="gb-card-desc">簡單介紹 cache 是什麼、cache line 的結構、cache hierarchy，以及 cache 能善用程式的哪些特性。</p>
				<div class="gb-card-stats">520 Words | Read Time: 6min</div>
			</a>

			<h3 class="gb-archive-year">2026</h3>
			<div class="gb-archive">
				<a class="gb-archive-item" href="#"><time>2026-07-01</time><span>3-6 1-factor（完美匹配）</span></a>
				<a class="gb-archive-item" href="#"><time>2026-07-01</time><span>01 Cache Fundamentals 快取基礎</span></a>
			</div>

			<article class="gb-prose" style="margin-top:48px">
				<p>Cache（快取）：一種高速的暫存資料儲存層，把 CPU 常用的、最近讀過的、算過的資料留一份在更方便取得的地方，當 CPU 下次需要時便能<strong>快速拿來使用</strong>。彎引號測試：“quoted” and ‘single’ — it’s Rubik.</p>
				<h2>Cache 的大致工作原理</h2>
				<p>Data Payload 一共有 64 Bytes（Memory Block 也是這個大小，方便對應），Control Metadata 則是存 Cache 系統運作時需要的資訊。</p>
				<ul class="gb-markers">
					<li><Icon name="ri-information-line" class="gb-marker-i" /><div>Tag Field：存放高位的記憶體位址，用來確認目前存的是哪個 Memory Block 的資料</div></li>
					<li><Icon name="ri-key-2-line" class="gb-marker-k" /><div>Valid bit：標記此資料是否有效（無過期）</div></li>
					<li><Icon name="ri-thumb-up-line" class="gb-marker-p" /><div>Temporal Locality：如果一個位址被 access，那麼短時間內會再被 access 數次。</div></li>
					<li><Icon name="ri-thumb-down-line" class="gb-marker-c" /><div>On a read, the value returned depends on which blocks are in the cache.</div></li>
				</ul>
				<div class="gb-callout" data-type="note">
					<div class="gb-callout-title"><Icon name="icon-pencil" /><span>其他 units 介紹</span></div>
					<div class="gb-callout-body"><p>TLB：Translation Lookaside Buffer，用來加速 virtual memory address 與 physical memory address 轉換。</p></div>
				</div>
				<h3>Tutte's 1-factor Theorem 證明</h3>
				<div class="gb-callout" data-type="success">
					<div class="gb-callout-title"><Icon name="icon-check" /><span>Tutte's 1-factor Theorem</span></div>
					<div class="gb-callout-body"><p>圖 <Fragment set:html={tex('G')} /> 存在完美匹配 <Fragment set:html={tex('\\iff \\forall S \\subseteq V(G),\\ o(G - S) \\le |S|')} /></p></div>
				</div>
				<div class="gb-callout is-foldable" data-type="question">
					<div class="gb-callout-title"><Icon name="icon-circle-help" /><span>Question</span><Icon name="icon-chevron-down" class="gb-fold" /></div>
					<div class="gb-callout-body"><p>完全圖 <Fragment set:html={tex('K_{2n}')} /> 有幾組完美匹配？</p></div>
				</div>
				<h4>構造 S</h4>
				<p>West 原文書的證明我看不太懂，所以從縮花演算法的角度來理解，而且還能順帶看出為什麼這個定理的 corollary 可以推出 Hall's Theorem。</p>
				<blockquote><p>若 G 沒有完美匹配，則存在 S 使 o(G − S) &gt; |S|。</p></blockquote>
			</article>
		</main>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
